'''Smoke Cloud'''{{unofficial}} is a [[Spells|spell]] that creates a large cloud of smoke.
==Description==
The casting seal contains a Sigil of [[Sigils#Smoke|Smoke]] surrounded evenly by eight inverted Signs of [[Signs#Columns|Columns]].

==Usage==
[[Olruggio]] once used this spell alongside [[Light Beam]] to intimidate a herd of [[Liongoat|liongoats]] chasing him and [[Qifrey]]. The combination of smoke and lights allow him to make an imposing shadow puppet to scare them off.{{Ref|m|91|4-5}}

